{"ref":"BDB, בֵּית הָֽעֲרָבָה","hw":"בֵּית הָֽעֲרָבָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הָֽעֲרָבָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong><em>place of the depression</em><strong>)</strong> reckoned to Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:6\" href=\"/Joshua.15.6\">Jos 15:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:61\" href=\"/Joshua.15.61\">61</a>, to Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:22\" href=\"/Joshua.18.22\">18:22</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽעֲרָבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:18\" href=\"/Joshua.18.18\">18:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽעֲרָבָ֑תָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:18\" href=\"/Joshua.18.18\">18</a>; cf. also <strong>adj.gent.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽעַרְבָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.31\">2 S 23:31</a> (perhaps read <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית־הָֽע׳</span> Klo cf. Dr) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.32\">1 Ch 11:32</a>;—site unknown.","next":"BDB, בֵּית פָּ֑לֶט","prev":"BDB, בֵּית־עֵ֫קֶד הָרֹעִים"}